```

### Services at a Glance

| Service | Stack | Role |
|---|---|---|
| **Frontend** | Next.js 14, TypeScript, Redux Toolkit, TanStack Query, Framer Motion, MUI | User-facing web application |
| **Backend** | Express 4, TypeScript, Prisma ORM, BullMQ, Pino, Helmet | REST API, auth, business logic, SQS dispatch |
| **Worker** | Node.js, TypeScript, AWS SQS, Gemini AI, Sharp, pdf-to-png | Async AI job processor |
| **Infrastructure** | AWS (EC2 ASG + ALB, RDS, ElastiCache, S3, SQS, CloudWatch), Terraform | Cloud deployment |

