## 3. Frontend — Next.js Application

### Tech Stack
- **Framework**: Next.js 14 (App Router)
- **Auth**: `@clerk/nextjs` — JWT-based, fully integrated
- **State**: Redux Toolkit + React Query (server state), Zustand (local/feature state)
- **UI**: MUI v5, Framer Motion, Lucide React, custom CSS
- **Forms**: React Hook Form + Zod
- **Maps**: `@react-google-maps/api`

### App Route Structure

```
src/app/
├── (auth)/             # Sign-in, Sign-up, OAuth callback
├── (app)/              # Protected application
│   ├── dashboard/      # Project list
│   ├── project/        # Multi-stage project pages
│   │   ├── [id]/floorplan/
│   │   ├── [id]/moodboard/
│   │   ├── [id]/elevation/
│   │   ├── [id]/2d-views/
│   │   ├── [id]/components/
│   │   └── [id]/walkthrough/
│   ├── upload/         # Floor plan upload
│   ├── entry/          # Intent collection
│   ├── onboarding/     # New user flow
│   ├── pricing/        # Plan selection
│   ├── checkout/       # Razorpay payment
│   ├── billing/        # Invoice history
│   ├── credits/        # Credit wallet
│   └── profile/        # User settings
├── (admin)/            # Admin-only pages
│   └── admin/          # Dashboard, user management
└── page.tsx            # Marketing landing page
```

### Feature Modules (`src/features/`)
- **`project/`** — Project CRUD, stage navigation, job polling
- **`moodboard/`** — Style selection, generation UI, regeneration
- **`intent/`** — Design intent questionnaire (SENSE layer)

