## 4. Backend API — Express Application

### Middleware Stack (in order)
1. `helmet` — security headers
2. `cors` — controlled origins
3. `express.json` (10 MB limit)
4. `requestIdMiddleware` — tracing
5. `morgan` → Pino logger
6. `rateLimiter` (Redis-backed)
7. `authMiddleware` (Clerk JWT)
8. `adminAuthMiddleware` (`@tatvaops.com` email gate)

