| `/api/exports` | Clerk | PDF export requests |
| `/api/sense` | Clerk | Intent Graph (SENSE AI layer) |
| `/api/think` | Clerk | Spatial Plan (THINK AI layer) |
| `/api/admin` | Clerk + Admin | Admin dashboard operations |

