## 5. Worker Service — AI Job Processor

### Architecture
- Polls **6 SQS queues** concurrently using long polling (20s wait)
- Configurable concurrency (`WORKER_CONCURRENCY`, default: 2)
- 2 replicas in Docker Compose production config
- Stateless — horizontally scalable

### Queue-to-Handler Map

| SQS Queue | Handler | AI Feature |
|---|---|---|
| `floorplan-analysis` | [floorplan-analysis.ts](file:///c:/Users/ayuvv/OneDrive/Documents/TatvaOps/tatvaops-vision/worker/src/handlers/floorplan-analysis.ts) | Gemini vision: parse floor plan image, detect rooms |
| `moodboard-generation` | [moodboard-generation.ts](file:///c:/Users/ayuvv/OneDrive/Documents/TatvaOps/tatvaops-vision/worker/src/handlers/moodboard-generation.ts) | Gemini: generate per-room interior moodboard image |
| `interior-view-generation` | Router → isometric or elevation | **NEW**: Full-floor isometric view (replaces per-wall elevation) |
| `notification` | [notification.ts](file:///c:/Users/ayuvv/OneDrive/Documents/TatvaOps/tatvaops-vision/worker/src/handlers/notification.ts) | Email (SES), WhatsApp (MSG91), SMS |
| `pdf-export` | [pdf-export.ts](file:///c:/Users/ayuvv/OneDrive/Documents/TatvaOps/tatvaops-vision/worker/src/handlers/pdf-export.ts) (~41KB) | Generate multi-page PDF design documents |
| `component-update` | (placeholder — not yet active) | Component catalog update |

> **Note**: The per-room wall elevation handler ([elevation-generation.ts](file:///c:/Users/ayuvv/OneDrive/Documents/TatvaOps/tatvaops-vision/worker/src/handlers/elevation-generation.ts)) is **deprecated** in favour of the full-floor isometric view ([interior-isometric-generation.ts](file:///c:/Users/ayuvv/OneDrive/Documents/TatvaOps/tatvaops-vision/worker/src/handlers/interior-isometric-generation.ts)).

