## 6. AI Pipeline — Design Engine

The `worker/src/design-engine/` directory is the core AI logic layer, cleanly separated from handlers. It exports reusable functions for all generation stages.

### Stage-by-Stage Flow

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A["Floor Plan\n(PDF/Image)"] --> B["1. Floor Plan Analysis\n(Gemini Vision)"]
    B --> C["Rooms Detected\n& Confirmed"]
    C --> D["2. Intent Questionnaire\n(SENSE Layer)"]
    D --> E["IntentGraph\n(Structured JSON)"]
    E --> F["3. Spatial Planning\n(THINK Layer)"]
    F --> G["SpatialPlan\n(Room + Component + Lighting)"]
    C --> H["4. Moodboard Generation\n(per room, Gemini Imagen)"]
    H --> I["5. Isometric Elevation\n(full floor, Gemini Imagen)"]
    H --> J["6. Room 2D Views\n(5 views per room)"]
    J --> K["7. Component Extraction\n(Gemini structured output)"]
    I --> L["8. Walkthrough Video\n(Veo 3.1)"]
    I --> M["9. PDF Export\n(PDFKit)"]
```

### Design Engine Modules

| Module | Key Files | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `floorplan/` | `analyzer.ts`, `preprocessing.ts`, `prompts.ts`, `room-graph.ts` | PDF→image conversion, Gemini room detection, geometry graph |
| `moodboard/` | `buildPrompt.ts`, `generateMoodboard.ts`, `intentMapper.ts`, `analyzeImage.ts` | Style intent → Gemini image prompt → moodboard |
| `isometric/` | (multiple) | Full-floor isometric elevation — **source of truth** |
| `elevation/` | (multiple) | **Deprecated** per-wall elevation |
| `room-2d-views/` | (multiple) | Front/back/left/right/ceiling 2D views per room |
| `walkthrough/` | `VeoClient`, `buildWalkthroughPrompt` | Veo 3.1 video generation |
| `component-extraction/` | (multiple) | Gemini structured output: sofa, bed, table, etc. |
| `sense/` | (multiple) | SENSE inference layer (intent understanding) |
| `think/` | `spatial-plan.builder.ts`, etc. | THINK spatial reasoning layer |
| `common/` | `gemini-client.ts` | Shared singleton Gemini client |

