## 7. Database Schema (PostgreSQL via Prisma)

### Core Models

```mermaid
erDiagram
    User ||--o{ Project : owns
    User ||--o| UserWallet : has
    User ||--o{ Subscription : has
    User ||--o{ Payment : makes
    Project ||--o{ Room : contains
    Project ||--o{ AIJob : triggers
    Project ||--o{ IsometricFloorElevation : has
    Project ||--o| IntentGraph : has
    Project ||--o| SpatialPlan : has
    Project ||--o{ ExportAsset : generates
    Room ||--o{ RoomMoodboard : has
    Room ||--o{ Room2DView : has
    Room ||--o{ RoomComponentExtraction : has
    Room ||--o{ RoomWalkthroughVideo : has
    UserWallet ||--o{ CreditTransaction : ledger
    Subscription }o--|| Plan : references
```

### Key Enums

**`ProjectStage`** (workflow stages):
`FLOOR_PLAN → INTENT → SPATIAL_PLANNING → MOODBOARD → ELEVATION → TWO_D_VIEWS → INTERIOR → COMPONENT → ROOM_WALKTHROUGH → EXPORT`

**`AIJobType`** (job types processed by worker):
`FLOORPLAN_ANALYSIS | MOODBOARD | INTERIOR_ISOMETRIC | TWO_D_VIEWS | COMPONENT_EXTRACTION | ROOM_WALKTHROUGH | PDF_EXPORT | SENSE_INFERENCE | SPATIAL_PLANNING`

**`RoomType`** (18 types):
`LIVING_ROOM | BEDROOM | KITCHEN | BATHROOM | DINING | TOILET | BALCONY | UTILITY | STORE | STUDY | PUJA | PASSAGE | STAIRCASE | LOBBY | FOYER | TERRACE | GARAGE | SERVANT_ROOM | DRESS | UNCLASSIFIED`

