## 8. Pricing & Plan System

Plans are defined as a **static catalog** in `backend/src/lib/plan-config.ts` (single source of truth).

| Plan | Price (₹) | Projects | Rooms/Project | Regen Limit | Walkthroughs | Components | DPR | Guided |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| **Starter** | ₹3,499 | 1 | 7 | 1 | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |
| **Standard** | ₹7,999 | 2 | 10 | 2 | ✅ 720p/1080p | Basic | ❌ | ❌ |
| **Pro** | ₹14,999 | 3 | 15 | 3 | ✅ 1080p/2K | Standard | Basic | ✅ |
| **Premium** | ₹29,999 | 5 | 20 | 5 | ✅ 4K | Advanced | Execution-grade | ✅ |

> **Note**: Starter price in config shows ₹9 (test price) — must be updated to ₹3,499 before production.

**Guardrails enforced by `plan-guardrails.ts`:**
- Project count limit (per user)
- Room count limit (per project, checked at floor plan analysis)
- Regeneration limit (per stage, per project)
- Feature access gating (pre-job creation)
- Rate limits: 10 project creates/hr, 20 regenerations/hr, 50 jobs/hr

**Payment flow**: Razorpay orders created server-side → webhook at `/api/webhooks/razorpay` → credits/subscription granted.

