## 9. Auth & Identity

- **Provider**: [Clerk](https://clerk.com) — handles sign-up, sign-in, JWTs, OAuth
- **Admin Gate**: `adminAuthMiddleware` checks for `@tatvaops.com` email domain
- **Internal Users**: `User.isInternal` flag + `internalRole` field; project-level plan override (`PlanSource.INTERNAL_OVERRIDE`) bypasses payment

