## 13. Data Flow — Core User Journey

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant BE as Backend
    participant SQS as AWS SQS
    participant W as Worker
    participant G as Gemini AI
    participant S3 as S3

    U->>FE: Upload floor plan PDF
    FE->>BE: POST /api/uploads (get presigned URL)
    FE->>S3: Direct upload
    FE->>BE: POST /api/projects (create project + queue job)
    BE->>SQS: Send to floorplan-analysis queue
    BE->>FE: Job ID + status QUEUED

    loop Poll every 2s
        FE->>BE: GET /api/jobs/:id
    end

    W->>SQS: Long poll, receive message
    W->>S3: Download floor plan
    W->>G: Gemini analysis (detect rooms)
    W->>S3: Store annotated result
    W->>BE (DB): Update AIJob status = COMPLETED

    FE->>BE: Job COMPLETED → fetch rooms
    U->>FE: Confirm rooms, select styles
    FE->>BE: POST /api/jobs (moodboard-generation)
    BE->>SQS: Send to moodboard-generation queue
    ... (same polling loop) ...
    W->>G: Gemini Imagen (generate moodboard)
    W->>S3: Store moodboard image
```

